    {
      "source": "Static factory method to create a <a href=\"HandlerMethodValidator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>HandlerMethodValidator</code></a> when Bean\nValidation is enabled for use via <a href=\"../../bind/support/ConfigurableWebBindingInitializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>ConfigurableWebBindingInitializer</code></a>,\nfor example in Spring MVC or WebFlux config.",
      "translation": "用于在启用 Bean 验证时通过 <a href=\"../../bind/support/ConfigurableWebBindingInitializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>ConfigurableWebBindingInitializer</code></a> 创建 <a href=\"HandlerMethodValidator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>HandlerMethodValidator</code></a> 的静态工厂方法，例如在 Spring MVC 或 WebFlux 配置中使用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>groups</code> - validation groups from <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#determineValidationGroups(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>MethodValidator.determineValidationGroups(Object, Method)</code></a>",
      "translation": "`groups` - 来自<a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#determineValidationGroups(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>MethodValidator.determineValidationGroups(Object, Method)</code></a>的验证组",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>target</code> - the target Object",
      "translation": "<code>target</code> - 目标对象",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>method</code> - the target method",
      "translation": "<code>method</code> - 目标方法",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Handles validation results by populating <a href=\"../../../validation/BindingResult.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>BindingResult</code></a> method\narguments with errors from <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationResult.html#getBeanResults()\"><code>beanResults</code></a>. Also, helps to determine parameter names for\n<code>@ModelAttribute</code> and <code>@RequestBody</code> parameters.",
      "translation": "通过用来自<a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationResult.html#getBeanResults()\"><code>beanResults</code></a>的错误填充<a href=\"../../../validation/BindingResult.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>BindingResult</code></a>方法参数来处理验证结果。此外，它还有助于确定<code>@ModelAttribute</code>和<code>@RequestBody</code>参数的参数名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegate to <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#validateArguments(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter%5B%5D,java.lang.Object%5B%5D,java.lang.Class%5B%5D)\"><code>MethodValidator.validateArguments(Object, Method, MethodParameter[], Object[], Class[])</code></a> and handle the validation result,\nby default raising <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>MethodValidationException</code></a> in case of errors.\nImplementations may provide alternative handling, for example, injecting\n<a href=\"../../../validation/Errors.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Errors</code></a> into the method.",
      "translation": "委托给 <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#validateArguments(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter%5B%5D,java.lang.Object%5B%5D,java.lang.Class%5B%5D)\"><code>MethodValidator.validateArguments(Object, Method, MethodParameter[], Object[], Class[])</code></a> 并处理验证结果，出错时默认抛出 <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>MethodValidationException</code></a>。实现可以提供替代的处理方式，例如将 <a href=\"../../../validation/Errors.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>Errors</code></a> 注入到方法中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegate to <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#validateArguments(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter%5B%5D,java.lang.Object%5B%5D,java.lang.Class%5B%5D)\"><code>MethodValidator.validateArguments(Object, Method, MethodParameter[], Object[], Class[])</code></a> and handle the validation result,\nby default raising <a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>MethodValidationException</code></a> in case of errors.",
      "translation": "委托给<a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidator.html#validateArguments(java.lang.Object,java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter%5B%5D,java.lang.Object%5B%5D,java.lang.Class%5B%5D)\"><code>MethodValidator.validateArguments(Object, Method, MethodParameter[], Object[], Class[])</code></a>并处理验证结果，出错时默认抛出<a href=\"../../../validation/method/MethodValidationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>MethodValidationException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
